+/*
+ * zrbfacore: Darkmoon Island strider races.
+ *
+ * Retail runs the races on server-side spells and area triggers that are not
+ * in the client data, so this is a rebuild from what the client does have:
+ * the quests (Malle Earnhard 74056: 37819, 37910; Patti Earnhard 90473:
+ * 37868, 37911), their kill-credit objectives, the Racing Strider mount
+ * (179750), the course bunnies on Darkmoon Island and the achievement spells
+ * (criteria "cast spell" 179420-179617).
+ *
+ * Run through the start banner with the quest and a Darkmoon Game Token: the
+ * token is used, you get the Racing Strider and the course bunnies become
+ * visible to you (they carry Invis to Non-Racers 179303, you get On a Trial
+ * 149669). Touch the posts in order and come back through the banner. The
+ * bell tolls every RACE_TOLL_MS; your toll count decides the achievements.
+ * Checkpoint banners give a speed boost and water walking, dash, jump,
+ * rocket and blink pads do what they say, the electrified tripwires between
+ * stakes take your mount speed away for a moment.
+ */
